{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "b6dcc08bc14ab0c17ec31d89d1588058f72a2ab259fdcb3f448dca461575bcc9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　そうなんです、\n何度脱いでも、すぐ着たくなるんですよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n对啊，每次一换下来，马上就又想穿穿看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fc63b5d6b7e3d4757b173f76233b78545206ff12cfb42d9f74a2d7c88c517312", "ja": "確かに、いいものに仕上がったとは思うけど……\n昨日も試着してたよな？", "zh": "这套服装确实做得很棒没错……\n但你昨天也试穿过了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "37f05a3e1d320b5f62e2bddf67f9d4a02b410dd55354b3717f446c8365fe4171", "ja": "当たり前じゃないですか！\nこんなステキな衣装、毎日着るに決まってますよ！", "zh": "那还用说吗！？\n这么棒的服装，当然要每天穿啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "886fa44170762d78e00f680f35170ee0915610964585de09904607241b2bf59b", "ja": "たしか今は、え～っと……\n本日8回目の試着タイムですっ。へへっ♪", "zh": "在下算算看，嗯……\n这是今天第八次试穿了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c6228a44a835feaa377bb59b2c595f000cc23815a3b10e00d42e2630e04235b4", "ja": "えっ。わざわざ8回も着替えて！？", "zh": "什么？你特地换了八次衣服！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "b1d11205ddcac04068c8de773ccecf379f01c0e3f7d6d3fcdc1543c4e28c46bb", "ja": "はい！　ホントはずーっと着てたいくらいですけど、\nそこはまあ、仕事もレッスンもありますからね。", "zh": "是的！其实在下很想一直穿在身上，\n但毕竟还是得去工作、上训练课程嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "607cf48c6a7bdfc9265943a800716e592a81b697c4cf73336153ad7552d8a9e8", "ja": "ジョギング、衣装っ！　筋トレ、衣装っ！\nレッスン、衣装っ！　……って感じです！", "zh": "慢跑，换服装！锻炼肌力，换服装！训练课程，换服装！\n……大致上是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d0be49122779b29d51a3c2200fdf4b7d6904c4358d0d08e07aa5c162968ccbf5", "ja": "そうか……。効率はさておき、\nそこまで気に入ってもらえたのなら、嬉しいよ。", "zh": "这样啊……先不论效率如何，\n看到你这么喜欢这套服装，我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "34bf72a8d3c048c500e9b485b0e004da02fc089bafd7145fba64537c1153f208", "ja": "あ、でもボクだって、ただ見てるだけじゃないですよ。\nちゃんと、かわいいポーズの研究もしてますからね！", "zh": "啊，不过在下可不只是穿起来欣赏喔。\n在下还很认真地钻研可爱的姿势呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "8eccad40b64a12850f04dda3d69bcca5dc45a1a0ce79507fbbf41f21d2a3503c", "ja": "こんな感じで……どうですか？", "zh": "像是这样……如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1fdddc35ae9ed5864375910f63edd76efc411e9996e9cd2980fb57615e4b2986", "ja": "おっ、いいんじゃないか。\n研究の成果、バッチリ出てるぞ。", "zh": "喔！很不错嘛。\n可以明显看出你有钻研过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "2fc51a66847c0d312cfb759dfed7807ec77220ae6076cdc8b86c05af84ddb3c2", "ja": "へへっ、やーりぃっ！　すぐに違いがわかるなんて、\nさっすが{$P$}ですよね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太棒啦！一眼就能看出不同，\n真不愧是{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "122bad526ff4e5a866a2591273947d88b2ca52cd3be3bd780133be3c05d33089", "ja": "ちゃんとボクのこと、見てくれてるんだなぁ～って、\nうれしくなっちゃいました♪", "zh": "原来你都有在关心在下呢～\n真令人开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "39ec5cdeceb4ae344bdf667d3ff59b6af081b2a7b1c911eb86d8b43876e7efee", "ja": "ま、担当アイドルのことだからな。\nそれこそ毎日見てるわけだし。", "zh": "毕竟你是我担当的偶像嘛。\n我本来就每天都在关心你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0054_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "c72ca7941374a1901d2350232de7377103c0060741fbef35e6666988068ecca0", "ja": "そっか。考えてみたら、ボクよりずっと、\nボクのこと……見てくれてるんですよね……。", "zh": "对耶，仔细想想，\n制作人对在下的关心……或许比在下自己还要多呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
